    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27444" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Măcer</span></b> , cri,
		m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				Roman surname</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> C. Licinius Macer, <i>an historian</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Leg. 1,
				2, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Brut. 67, 238</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 4, 7,
