        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Aemilius Macer, <i>a poet and a friend of
				Virgil and Ovid</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. Tr. 4, 10, 44</span></i>; v.
		Aemilius.</div>
